{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:42:03+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:42:03+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Tate & Lyle plc","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://www.tateandlyle.com","employees":4840,"summary":"Tate & Lyle plc, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the provision of ingredients and solutions to the food, beverages, and other industries in North America, Asia, Middle East, Africa, Latin America, and Europe. Its portfolio includes sweeteners, fibres, stabilisers and functional systems, hydrocolloids, and starches, proteins, and functional flours. The company's products are used in beverages, dairy, soups, sauces and dressings, bakery and snacks, confectionery, household, clinical nutrition, industrial, meat and seafood, and personal care applications. The company has a strategic collaboration with BioHarvest Sciences Inc. The company was incorporated in 1903 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Tate & Lyle plc, avec ses filiales, se consacre à la fourniture d'ingrédients et de solutions aux industries alimentaires, des boissons et autres en Amérique du Nord, en Asie, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique, en Amérique latine et en Europe. Son portefeuille comprend des édulcorants, des fibres, des stabilisants et des systèmes fonctionnels, des hydrocolloïdes, des amidons, des protéines et des farines fonctionnelles. Les produits de la société sont utilisés dans les boissons, les produits laitiers, les soupes, les sauces et les vinaigrettes, la boulangerie et les collations, la confiserie, les produits ménagers, la nutrition clinique, les applications industrielles, la viande et les fruits de mer et les soins personnels."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":2496064512,"share